eally coats every single  lash my lashes are so straight but this  gave them a nice curl I wish it  thickened my lashes more but for six  bucks this is a really good drugstore  mascara these NYX jumbo lash lashes are  so easy to apply and the band is really  comfortable I think these have totally  convinced me to wear lashes more often  the Nyx Thicket stick it brow gel is a  thickening brow mascara if you look  really close you can see those little  fibers that are supposed to make your  brows look fluffier I really like the  natural full brow effect you get with  this next let's talk about lip products  this is the Maybelline Super Stay vinyl  ink long wear no budge liquid lip color  this is a long wearing lipstick that's  meant to stay shiny you have to shake it  for five seconds then apply even though  I did get a little transfer and the  shine isn't long lasting the lipstick  itself stays super bright and doesn't  budge these are the L'Oreal coloration  tense volume matte lipsticks the color  payoff on these is so good and they  apply really smoothly this is one of the  most comfortable matte formulas I've  ever tried especially from the drugstore  the Jason Wu extra pout lip plumper is a  Holy Grail product for me even if you  don't care about the lip Plumping aspect  this is one of the best lip gloss  formulas I've ever tried it's so  cushiony and shiny and amazing and  everyone should get it this elf cookies  and dreams lip gloss in cookie dreams is  a black lip gloss with a bunch of pretty  blue and silver glitter throughout on  its own it gives a bluish black tint I  love it more over other lip products  it's really good for deepening colors in  the formula of the gloss itself is  actually really nice for the four dollar  price point I only tested one hair  product this year and that was the Eco  Styler unicorn glitter gel it's a  translucent pink color with blue  iridescent Sparkles running this through  my hair you don't really get the  glittery effect you can see the glitter  and color better when I apply it to  brushed back straight hair this is so  cute for a little glitter moment every  once in a while and it actually washed  out of my hair easily  [Music]
 

